*  EMPSCHM - the personnel network database the payroll batch reads.
ADD SCHEMA NAME IS EMPSCHM VERSION IS 100
    SCHEMA DESCRIPTION IS 'PERSONNEL'.
ADD AREA NAME IS EMP-REGION.
ADD RECORD NAME IS DEPARTMENT
    RECORD ID IS 410
    LOCATION MODE IS CALC USING DEPT-ID DUPLICATES ARE NOT ALLOWED
    WITHIN AREA EMP-REGION.
    02 DEPT-ID          PIC 9(4).
    02 DEPT-NAME        PIC X(45).
    02 FILLER           PIC X(3).
ADD RECORD NAME IS EMPLOYEE
    RECORD ID IS 415
    LOCATION MODE IS VIA DEPT-EMPLOYEE SET
    WITHIN AREA EMP-REGION.
    02 EMP-ID           PIC 9(4).
    02 EMP-NAME.
       03 FIRST-NAME    PIC X(10).
       03 LAST-NAME     PIC X(15).
    02 STATUS-CODE      PIC X(2).
       88 ACTIVE        VALUE '01'.
       88 RETIRED       VALUE '02' '03'.
    02 SALARY           PIC S9(7)V99 USAGE COMP-3.
ADD SET NAME IS DEPT-EMPLOYEE
    ORDER IS SORTED
    MODE IS CHAIN LINKED TO PRIOR
    OWNER IS DEPARTMENT NEXT DBKEY POSITION IS AUTO
    MEMBER IS EMPLOYEE NEXT DBKEY POSITION IS AUTO
        MANDATORY AUTOMATIC
        ASCENDING KEY IS (LAST-NAME) DUPLICATES ARE LAST.
VALIDATE.
